{"id":"n23474-1-6","stage":4,"title":"안전벨트 · 安全带","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23474-1-6-1","ko":"어제 교통사고를 당했다면서요? 괜찮아요?","zh":"听说你昨天出了车祸？没事吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"교통사고를","meaning":"交通事故","explanation":"교통사고：交通事故；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"교통사고","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35968","senseId":"1","lemma":"교통사고","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"당했다면서요?","meaning":"遭遇，遭受","explanation":"당하다：遭遇，遭受；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；다면서요：引用所听到的陈述，再向对方确认：“听说……，是吗？”","readings":[{"term":"당하다","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14730","senseId":"5","lemma":"당하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"괜찮아요?","meaning":"无恙，没事","explanation":"괜찮다：无恙，没事；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"괜찮다","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60097","senseId":"2","lemma":"괜찮다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"28bb225f685ceba3","term":"교통사고","zh":"交通事故","audio":"/audio/28bb225f685ceba3c5b7.mp3","entryId":"35968","definition":"汽车或火车等与其他交通工具相撞或撞到人的事故。","pronunciation":["교통사고"]},{"id":"9c2599f3570a2b0a","term":"당하다","zh":"遭遇，遭受","audio":"/audio/9c2599f3570a2b0ad6c8.mp3","entryId":"14730","definition":"经历不好的事情。","pronunciation":["당하다"]},{"id":"b9a2699f824000e3","term":"괜찮다","zh":"无恙，没事","audio":"/audio/b9a2699f824000e36e45.mp3","entryId":"60097","definition":"没有特别的问题。","pronunciation":["괜찬타"]}],"audio":"/audio/9e4a17cc6b040fa099a4.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23474-1-6-2","ko":"네. 안전벨트 덕분에 다행히 별로 다치지 않았어요.","zh":"嗯。多亏系了安全带，幸好没受太严重的伤。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안전벨트","meaning":"安全带","explanation":"안전벨트：安全带","readings":[{"term":"안전벨트","audio":"/audio/09cb62ed0c4adecfcc01.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23474","senseId":"1","lemma":"안전벨트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덕분에","meaning":"托福，关怀，恩德","explanation":"덕분：托福，关怀，恩德；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"덕분","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47410","senseId":"1","lemma":"덕분","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다행히","meaning":"幸运，万幸，走运","explanation":"다행히：幸运，万幸，走运","readings":[{"term":"다행히","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23910","senseId":"1","lemma":"다행히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"별로","meaning":"特别，格外","explanation":"별로：特别，格外","readings":[{"term":"별로","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58301","senseId":"1","lemma":"별로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다치지","meaning":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","explanation":"다치다：受伤，负伤，弄伤；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"다치다","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73400","senseId":"1","lemma":"다치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어요.","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71581","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"09cb62ed0c4adecf","term":"안전벨트","zh":"安全带","audio":"/audio/09cb62ed0c4adecfcc01.mp3","entryId":"23474","definition":"汽车或飞机等中，为了避免出事故时受伤而将身体拴在座椅上的带子。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"4863a9a8be42033e","term":"덕분","zh":"托福，关怀，恩德","audio":"/audio/4863a9a8be42033e7d79.mp3","entryId":"47410","definition":"某人给予的关照或帮助；或某事发生后带来的好处。","pronunciation":["덕뿐"]},{"id":"7b75f0048465d767","term":"다행히","zh":"幸运，万幸，走运","audio":"/audio/7b75f0048465d767cd7f.mp3","entryId":"23910","definition":"意外地运气好地。","pronunciation":["다행히"]},{"id":"ebf90bac22cca4cd","term":"별로","zh":"特别，格外","audio":"/audio/ebf90bac22cca4cd47d8.mp3","entryId":"58301","definition":"特殊额外地；或指那么不同地。","pronunciation":["별로"]},{"id":"128510caa5a5a0b6","term":"다치다","zh":"受伤，负伤，弄伤","audio":"/audio/128510caa5a5a0b67924.mp3","entryId":"73400","definition":"被撞到或被打后身上或身体的一部分出现伤口；或指使出现伤口。","pronunciation":["다치다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71581","definition":"用于否定前文所指的行为。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/60d790181b8a9993fea3.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.856,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=23474","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":137,"sequenceScore":2.6827,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯。多亏系了安全带，幸好没受太严重的伤。","我打算用传统方式举办婚礼。","听说你昨天出了车祸？没事吧？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["嗯。多亏系了安全带，幸好没受太严重的伤。","听说你昨天出了车祸？没事吧？","我打算用传统方式举办婚礼。"],"answer":0}]}
